+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm for the authentication system. It was chosen for its resistance to GPU-accelerated brute-force attacks, since it is both memory-hard and time-hard, and for its resistance to side-channel attacks. No specific cost parameters (memory, iterations, parallelism) have been recorded.
